<%# What to offer on a message that did not go out.

    A plain Retry is only honest when retrying could work. A send to a recipient
    with no kind 10050 already went out best-effort to relays they never
    designated, so if it failed there, repeating it will fail the same way — offer
    the legacy route instead, which is the one that actually reaches clients with
    no private-messaging support. Same risks spelled out as in the composer. %>
<% undeliverable = delivery == :best_effort && !message.legacy? %>

<div class="mt-1 rounded-lg border border-red-300 bg-red-50 p-3 text-left dark:border-red-800 dark:bg-red-900/30">
  <p class="text-xs font-medium text-red-900 dark:text-red-200">Not sent</p>
  <% if message.error.present? %>
    <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-red-800 dark:text-red-300"><%= message.error %></p>
  <% end %>

  <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
    <% unless undeliverable %>
      <%= button_to "Try again", retry_message_path(message), method: :post,
            class: "rounded-md bg-red-600 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-white hover:bg-red-500" %>
    <% end %>
  </div>

  <% if undeliverable %>
    <details class="mt-2">
      <summary class="cursor-pointer text-xs font-medium text-orange-800 dark:text-orange-300">
        Send it as a legacy message instead?
      </summary>
      <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-orange-800 dark:text-orange-300">
        They cannot receive private messages at all, so this is the only way it will
        reach them — but it is a real downgrade:
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-1 list-disc space-y-0.5 pl-4 text-xs text-orange-800 dark:text-orange-300">
        <% Message::LEGACY_DOWNGRADE_RISKS.each do |risk| %>
          <li><%= risk %></li>
        <% end %>
      </ul>
      <%# Same wording as the composer: accepting a downgrade must never look like
          the ordinary action. %>
      <%= button_to "Send with public metadata", downgrade_message_path(message), method: :post,
            class: "mt-2 rounded-md bg-orange-600 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-white hover:bg-orange-500" %>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-orange-700 dark:text-orange-400">
        This moves it to a separate legacy thread with the same person.
      </p>
    </details>
  <% end %>
</div>
